\f0\fs32 \cf0 # FD Multi-Space tool\
\
The FD Multi-Space tool is a Python script for Maya that allows you to create add feature to your RIG and helps with parenting in several different ways.\
\
## System Requirements\
\
- Autodesk Maya 2018 or later           \
- Python 2.7 or later\
\
\
## Installation\
\
1. Download the \'93FD_MULTI-SPACE.zip" file.\
2. Extract the content of FD_Multi-Space-Tool.zip into your Maya script folder. Example \'91./maya/2023/script/\'85\'92\
3. You need to have both FD_Multi_Space_tool_no_reference.py and FD_Multi_Space_tool_reference.py files into your local /script/ folder.\
4. Open Autodesk Maya.\
5. Open the Script Editor and in a new Python tab, paste the content of the file "FD_Multi_Space_tool_GUI.py" \
6. Select all the code and run the script by clicking the "Run" button or using the keyboard shortcut "Ctrl + Enter".\
7. You can also \'91Save Script To Shelf\'92 to have always the button ready to call the MULTI-Space-tool\
\
I hope you find the FD Multi-Space tool useful. Happy Animating!\
\
